>term isMetachar = (λc.lists.foldl (λacc.λm.logic.or acc (equality.equal c m)) false [46:int32, 94:int32, 36:int32, 42:int32, 43:int32, 63:int32, 40:int32, 41:int32, 91:int32, 93:int32, 123:int32, 125:int32, 124:int32, 92:int32])@{description="True if the codepoint is a top-level regex metacharacter that must be escaped to match literally."}
