>term literalAtom = (parsers.map (λc.regex.Atom{literal = c}) (parsers.alt escapedChar (parsers.satisfy (λc.logic.not (isMetachar c)))))@{description="Parse a literal character (an escaped metacharacter, or any ordinary non-metacharacter) into an Atom."}
