>term parseRegex = (λinput.cases(parsing.ParseResult){success=λs.logic.ifElse (lists.isEmpty (parsing.ParseInput[codepoints] (parsing.ParseSuccess[remainder] s))) given(parsing.ParseSuccess[value] s) none, failure=λe.none} (parsers.runParser regex input))@{description="Parse a full regex pattern string into a hydra.core.regex AST. Returns nothing if the pattern is ill-formed or does not consume all input; a well-formed pattern is exactly one that parses here, so 'well-formed' is portable across all hosts."}
