>term regexSequence = (parsers.many quantified)@{description="Parse a sequence of quantified atoms (a single alternation branch). May be empty only as the whole pattern; as an alternation branch it is constrained to be non-empty by the alternation parser's use of sepBy1 plus a non-empty check."}
